  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ireland Civil Society Programme (ICSP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme will contribute towards reducing inequalities and poverty among Malawian citizens especially women, girls and youth living in vulnerable situations. Project will be implemented in Malawi in Mchinji and Kasungu Districts in partnership with local partners, networks and movements and Government partners over period of five years from January 2023 to December 2027.</narrative>
  </description>
